WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.018
If a coin rolls on your workbench, your floor has already won.

00:00:06.298 --> 00:00:08.442
Here is the small part that fixes it.

00:00:09.042 --> 00:00:10.901
Factory floors are rarely flat.

00:00:11.181 --> 00:00:17.397
A bench that rocks even slightly spoils measurements, loosens fixtures and tires the operator,

00:00:17.397 --> 00:00:19.976
especially during torquing or grinding.

00:00:20.256 --> 00:00:23.749
It also makes even a well-built bench feel unsteady and cheap.

00:00:24.349 --> 00:00:26.618
Levelling glides sit under every leg.

00:00:26.898 --> 00:00:31.963
Turn the glide under the low corner, check with a spirit level along and across the top,

00:00:31.963 --> 00:00:33.287
then press each corner.

00:00:33.567 --> 00:00:35.330
If nothing rocks, you are level.

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:40.405
It takes only a few minutes, and you need nothing more than a spirit level and your hands.

00:00:41.005 --> 00:00:43.820
Every Furnisys bench comes with levelling glides.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:50.201
For rough or uneven trimix floors, we fit threaded stud levellers, M12 by 25,

00:00:50.201 --> 00:00:53.925
giving 10 to 15 millimetres of fine adjustment.

00:00:54.525 --> 00:00:57.575
Level it on day one and again whenever the bench moves.

00:00:57.855 --> 00:01:01.569
Try the coin test today and tell us the result in the comments.

00:01:01.849 --> 00:01:04.251
Next up: how to choose the right worktop.

00:01:04.851 --> 00:01:09.096
Furnisys: complete workspace systems, planned around your process.

